name 'ai-generated-design-preassessment-q1_2025'

question 'A popular food-delivery app recently moved its "Order Again" button to a hidden menu and users complain it takes longer to reorder their favorite meals. What design mistake did the app make?'

wrong 'It used too many bright colors'
right 'It ignored users\' main goals and needs.'
wrong 'It made the app load too slowly.'
wrong 'It added too many security features.'

allow_multiple_attempts true

